{"page":432,"verses":[{"verse_key":"34:32","surah":34,"ayah":32,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ ٱلَّذِينَ ٱسْتَكْبَرُوا۟ لِلَّذِينَ ٱسْتُضْعِفُوٓا۟ أَنَحْنُ صَدَدْنَـٰكُمْ عَنِ ٱلْهُدَىٰ بَعْدَ إِذْ جَآءَكُم ۖ بَلْ كُنتُم مُّجْرِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The oppressors will say to them, ‘Was it we who prevented you from following right guidance after it had reached you? No! You yourselves were sinners.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"Will say","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"34:32"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"34:32"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱسْتَكْبَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"were arrogant","transliteration":"is'takbarū","verse_key":"34:32"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"to those","transliteration":"lilladhīna","verse_key":"34:32"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱسْتُضْعِفُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"who were oppressed","transliteration":"us'tuḍ'ʿifū","verse_key":"34:32"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَنَحْنُ","en_gloss":"Did we","transliteration":"anaḥnu","verse_key":"34:32"},{"pos":7,"ar":"صَدَدْنَـٰكُمْ","en_gloss":"avert you","transliteration":"ṣadadnākum","verse_key":"34:32"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَنِ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿani","verse_key":"34:32"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْهُدَىٰ","en_gloss":"the guidance","transliteration":"l-hudā","verse_key":"34:32"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بَعْدَ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿda","verse_key":"34:32"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"34:32"},{"pos":12,"ar":"جَآءَكُم ۖ","en_gloss":"it had come to you","transliteration":"jāakum","verse_key":"34:32"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"34:32"},{"pos":14,"ar":"كُنتُم","en_gloss":"you were","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"34:32"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مُّجْرِمِينَ","en_gloss":"criminals","transliteration":"muj'rimīna","verse_key":"34:32"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٣٢","en_gloss":"(32)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"34:32"}]},{"verse_key":"34:33","surah":34,"ayah":33,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالَ ٱلَّذِينَ ٱسْتُضْعِفُوا۟ لِلَّذِينَ ٱسْتَكْبَرُوا۟ بَلْ مَكْرُ ٱلَّيْلِ وَٱلنَّهَارِ إِذْ تَأْمُرُونَنَآ أَن نَّكْفُرَ بِٱللَّهِ وَنَجْعَلَ لَهُۥٓ أَندَادًا ۚ وَأَسَرُّوا۟ ٱلنَّدَامَةَ لَمَّا رَأَوُا۟ ٱلْعَذَابَ وَجَعَلْنَا ٱلْأَغْلَـٰلَ فِىٓ أَعْنَاقِ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ ۚ هَلْ يُجْزَوْنَ إِلَّا مَا كَانُوا۟ يَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The oppressed will say to them, ‘No, it was your scheming, night and day, ordering us to disbelieve in God and set up rivals to Him.’ When they see the punishment, they will fall silent with regret, and We shall put iron collars on the disbelievers’ necks. Why should they be rewarded for anything other than what they have done?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَالَ","en_gloss":"And will say","transliteration":"waqāla","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱسْتُضْعِفُوا۟","en_gloss":"were oppressed","transliteration":"us'tuḍ'ʿifū","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"to those who","transliteration":"lilladhīna","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱسْتَكْبَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"were arrogant","transliteration":"is'takbarū","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَكْرُ","en_gloss":"(it was) a plot","transliteration":"makru","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلَّيْلِ","en_gloss":"(by) night","transliteration":"al-layli","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱلنَّهَارِ","en_gloss":"and (by) day","transliteration":"wal-nahāri","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تَأْمُرُونَنَآ","en_gloss":"you were ordering us","transliteration":"tamurūnanā","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":13,"ar":"نَّكْفُرَ","en_gloss":"we disbelieve","transliteration":"nakfura","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَنَجْعَلَ","en_gloss":"and we set up","transliteration":"wanajʿala","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لَهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"for Him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":17,"ar":"أَندَادًۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"equals","transliteration":"andādan","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":18,"ar":"وَأَسَرُّوا۟","en_gloss":"But they will conceal","transliteration":"wa-asarrū","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱلنَّدَامَةَ","en_gloss":"the regret","transliteration":"l-nadāmata","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":20,"ar":"لَمَّا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"lammā","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":21,"ar":"رَأَوُا۟","en_gloss":"they see","transliteration":"ra-awū","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":22,"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابَ","en_gloss":"the punishment","transliteration":"l-ʿadhāba","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":23,"ar":"وَجَعَلْنَا","en_gloss":"And We will put","transliteration":"wajaʿalnā","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":24,"ar":"ٱلْأَغْلَـٰلَ","en_gloss":"shackles","transliteration":"l-aghlāla","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":25,"ar":"فِىٓ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":26,"ar":"أَعْنَاقِ","en_gloss":"(the) necks","transliteration":"aʿnāqi","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":27,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":28,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟ ۚ","en_gloss":"disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":29,"ar":"هَلْ","en_gloss":"Will","transliteration":"hal","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":30,"ar":"يُجْزَوْنَ","en_gloss":"they be recompensed","transliteration":"yuj'zawna","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":31,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":32,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"(for) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"34:33"},{"pos":33,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they used to","transliteration":"kānū","verse_